    description: "alertmanager reflect (deep-20260406-233120): 'Verbs like Expire, Delete, Remove, GC, Reset, Truncate, Drop, Clear, Init, Reload should also be tagged access_mode=write. Currently Silences.Expire (9 calls), Marker.SetActiveOrSilenced (6 calls), Marker.Delete are not write-tagged.' Easy YAML config addition — extend go.yaml library_patterns to cover the missing verb suffixes."  # 11b0
