  message: "Merged in PR iterabloom/hypergumbo#2748 (commit 6e960640e). Added six new write verbs to go.yaml library_patterns: Expire, GC, Truncate, Drop, Init, Reload. New test TestGoLibraryPatterns.test_expanded_write_verbs_match verifies all six match in a representative function body. Scope expansion to other languages tracked in WI-vinub (P4)."  # c568
